+/*
+ * A V4L2 driver for onsemi AR0234 global shutter Raw cameras.
+ *
+ * 4-lane MIPI CSI-2, 10-bit RAW (GRBG), 24MHz MCLK.
+ * Register sequences ported from the Raspberry Pi/Kurokesu ar0234 driver:
+ * PLL 24MHz -> 450MHz link (900Mbps/lane), 90MHz VT pixel clock.
+ *
+ * NOTE: AR0234 registers are 16-bit address / 16-bit data, EXCEPT the 8-bit
+ * pairs 0x301C/0x301D (MODE_SELECT/IMAGE_ORIENTATION) and 0x3022/0x3023
+ * (GROUPED_PARAMETER_HOLD/-). They are accessed as one 16-bit register: the
+ * high byte lands in the first address, the low byte in the second.
+ */
